note lists, subscripts, builtins, push, characters, text, kind
xs is [3, 1, 2]
show length of xs
show first of xs
show last of xs
show xs[0]
show xs[-1]
show "hello"[1]
push 4 to xs
show xs
show uppercase of "hello"
show lowercase of "HeLLo"
show trim of "  padded  "
show split of "a,b,c" by ","
show join of ["a", "b"] with "-"
show characters of "abc"
show text of 3.5
show text of 3.0
show text of nothing
show kind of 1
show kind of "s"
show kind of [1]
show kind of true
show kind of nothing
show text of [1, "two", [3]]
